:NOTE
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.

:INFO
If a financial intermediary that is directly subject to FINMA until the Act enters into force affiliates to a self-regulatory organisation under Article 24 AMLA, it shall submit a report to the self-regulatory organisation on the conformity of its business activities with the provisions of the AMLA.

